- **Perspectives covered:** §10 — epistemic/falsifiability, adversarial, sampling, measure-correctness,
  contract hygiene, economic, scope discipline, constitutional posture.
- **No orphan:** every component C1–C8 has a named producer and a named consumer on the §5 data flow;
  every acceptance check AC-1..AC-4 maps to an emitter rule (§4.2); every one of the twelve §4.3 node
  types carries an explicit disposition (§2) — headline, deferred-by-design, or secondary census.
- **No gap:** the four checks that constitute the goal's acceptance are each satisfied by a specified
